# Internal engineering docs. Nothing reads these at runtime (verified: no route,
# no dashboard handler, no config path touches docs/), and every one of them is
# excluded from the public copy BY NAME for containing personal data. `COPY . .`
# would otherwise bake them into any image built from this tree — and a
# container layer, once pulled, cannot be recalled.
#
# CHANGELOG.md is deliberately NOT here: routes/whatsnew_api.py reads it to
# render the in-app "What's new" popup. It is excluded from the PUBLIC COPY
# instead, so a published image never contains it either.
docs/HANDOFF.md
docs/BACKLOG.md
docs/documentation_guide.md
